  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 20th level, an etherknight has become a true paragon in the art of managing the gifts of the ether. He may now expend focus as though it were fusion points and fusion points as though they were focus; however, he may only expend a cumulative number of substituted points each day equal to his Charisma modifier (min 1) in this fashion.</p>\n<hr>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/etherknight#toc18\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
